{"version":1,"key":"card:419","content":{"id":419,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b5b6118-f89d-4eed-9278-c7d1f2ca5257","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在程序需要进行输入输出操作时，会发起系统调用，接着设备驱动程序启动 I/O，有三种方式来进行输入输出："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"c4216f10-2d69-4ca0-86fc-cf3d011c2f6e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c84d24fe-9b4e-47cd-83fd-5129d1f48b37","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6394814b-2a21-4f45-ae2c-d9632701f8c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"轮询：CPU 一直轮询检查数据准备好没有，在这个过程中，CPU 一直在循环等待，不能执行其它任务，待数据准备好了之后，CPU 执行相应的 I/O 指令来进行读写操作，CPU 大量的时间耗费在轮询上。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9326e218-74f7-40f2-bb42-535b3261d25e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d766280b-5dc1-4d48-8df9-1d6e89afbef1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中断：CPU 不再一直等待 I/O 设备数据准备完成，而是让设备在完成操作后发出一个中断，接着挂起当前任务，执行其它任务，等数据准备完成时，设备发出中断信号，CPU 停止当前正在执行的任务，根据中断信号跳转到相应的中断处理程序来执行 I/O 操作。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e6f1501a-efa4-4be3-9562-bb57aff607e3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66655a43-af8c-4544-ba79-07bd023ddf2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中断 + DMA（Direct Memory Access）：上述两种方式数据传输过程中均有 CPU 参与，CPU 需要执行相应的 I/O 指令将数据先从 I/O 设备读入到寄存器，然后执行 I/O 指令将数据写入到内存中。这个过程是低效的，可以使用一个专门的芯片执行设备与内存直接的数据交换，而不需要 CPU 参与，这个芯片就是 DMA 芯片。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c9e253a-2306-4976-9214-a961567b46c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在数据准备完成后，CPU 对 DMA 进行设置，说明需要传递的字节数，相关设备、内存地址和操作方向（输入还是输出），接着启动 DMA，DMA 将数据在设备和内存之间进行移动（不同于 CPU 一次传输一个字，DMA 可以一次性移动多个字），在设置完 DMA 后，CPU 可以执行其它的任务，等到 DMA 将数据移动完成时，它会发出一个中断，CPU 跳转到相应的中断处理程序进行处理。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["操作系统/输入输出"],"createTime":1711865770154,"updateTime":1755939062370,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755939062370}}